    LLM: 'Game: Arlington. Type: Contract Rummy. Rules: 105 cards. 7 hands. 2s and Joker are wild. Wild-replacement allowed. Offering Phase after turn. Aces/Wilds offered to left only. Goal: Most points after 7 hands.',
    Player: "Welcome to Arlington (Oklahoma Rummy). We're playing Hand 1: The contract is two sets of three. Draw your card, then look at the tableâ€”can you steal a wild by replacing it with a natural card Don't forget, after you play, you MUST offer a card to the group!",
    tagline: 'Fulfill the contract. Steal the wilds. Out-offer your rivals.',
