          evolution: "The game evolved from basic Rummy by adding 'wild-replacement' rules, where players could liberate wild cards from opponents' melds using natural cards.",
          cultural: "Known as a 'long-form' social game, often played during weekend gatherings where the 7-hand progression can be fully appreciated.",
          hasPlaceholders: false,
