          deckDescription: 'One hundred five cards total: two standard 52-card decks combined plus one joker. Each deck has four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs) with thirteen ranks; the joker and all twos are wild in this game.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs) appear in duplicate (two full decks). Suits do not determine hand rank; wild cards (twos and joker) can substitute for any suit and rank.',
